Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 5

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P005

Summary: Passive MK7 sensor fusion, rewards and performance diagnostics

Description: |
    Extends the MK7 flight recorder with fused normal dash-panel
    detection, time-based lower-overhead telemetry polling, passive
    B/brake correlation, and raw sensor/performance CSV diagnostics.
    Provisional progress/time/lap reward weights are unchanged.
    No controller injection, game-memory edits, autonomous driving,
    training, or in-race file writes.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
